      "last": {
        "speaker": 2,
        "line": 840,
        "text": "When I was in high school I used to imag- ine standing up at something like this. I thought it would be about glory. Showing people. It’s different. Somebody told me it would be, and I didn’t believe him, but now that I’m standing here I know it. It’s about doing the job right."
      }
